WEBVTT

00:00:04.262 --> 00:00:06.438
Wings of Surveillance!

00:00:06.482 --> 00:00:08.571
Why do you do that?
Do what?

00:00:08.615 --> 00:00:10.312
Just because you say "Wings of"
before something...

00:00:10.355 --> 00:00:12.053
it doesn't mean that you're
doing a special move.

00:00:12.096 --> 00:00:14.272
It's like me saying
"Antenna of Power"

00:00:14.316 --> 00:00:17.406
or "Thorax of
Making Sandwiches."

00:00:17.449 --> 00:00:19.136
Wings of Disagreement.

00:00:19.189 --> 00:00:20.690
Whoa! There.

00:00:21.976 --> 00:00:24.152
CRANE: Master Bear,
Master Chicken, Master Croc!

00:00:24.195 --> 00:00:25.762
What are you doing out here?

00:00:25.806 --> 00:00:27.416
[CLUCKING] Jade creatures
attacked our villages.

00:00:27.459 --> 00:00:28.803
[CLUCKING]
We've tracked them here.

00:00:28.846 --> 00:00:30.056
Stop!

00:00:32.464 --> 00:00:35.380
They must be in there.

00:00:35.424 --> 00:00:37.127
Master Shifu strongly
advised us...

00:00:37.140 --> 00:00:38.558
[ROARING]

00:00:39.341 --> 00:00:41.082
[YELLING]

00:00:41.125 --> 00:00:42.910
not to engage.

00:00:42.953 --> 00:00:44.259
We've gotta get in there.
But Master Shifu said...

00:00:44.302 --> 00:00:45.869
You're seriously afraid?

00:00:45.913 --> 00:00:48.350
Even Master Chicken's going
in there! And he's a chicken.

00:00:48.393 --> 00:00:49.714
[CLUCKING]

00:00:55.052 --> 00:00:57.098
[CLUCKS LOUDLY]

00:00:57.141 --> 00:00:59.056
[GASPS]
That's it. I'm going in.

00:00:59.100 --> 00:01:00.320
Mantis! We have orders
not to...

00:01:00.334 --> 00:01:01.342
They need our help!

00:01:01.366 --> 00:01:03.104
Come on.
I'll go high, you go low.

00:01:03.147 --> 00:01:04.294
[WHISPERING] No, wait.

00:01:04.888 --> 00:01:06.368
Fear the bug!

00:01:06.411 --> 00:01:07.848
All right, you little...

00:01:07.891 --> 00:01:09.284
Uh-oh!

00:01:09.327 --> 00:01:10.866
Hold on, buddy.
I'm coming!

00:01:10.870 --> 00:01:12.853
Antenna of Power!
Ah! It didn't work!

00:01:12.896 --> 00:01:14.220
Mantis!

00:01:18.902 --> 00:01:20.180
Mantis?

00:01:21.383 --> 00:01:23.037
[WHISPERING] Mantis.

00:01:23.994 --> 00:01:25.811
[GASPS]

00:01:27.607 --> 00:01:29.521
[WHISTLING]

00:01:29.565 --> 00:01:31.567
[GRUNTING]

00:01:32.873 --> 00:01:34.284
[SNORTS]

00:01:35.440 --> 00:01:37.244
Your chi is strong.

00:01:38.008 --> 00:01:39.866
Just like your friend...

00:01:40.141 --> 00:01:41.478
the bug.

00:01:41.882 --> 00:01:43.057
[GASPS] Mantis.

00:01:45.233 --> 00:01:46.843
[CRANE SCREAMING]

00:01:49.106 --> 00:01:50.151
[GROANS]

00:01:52.109 --> 00:01:53.654
Don't worry, little birdie.

00:01:54.503 --> 00:01:56.597
I'll put your chi
to good use...

00:01:57.593 --> 00:02:01.292
destroying the Jade Palace
and everyone in it.

00:02:01.902 --> 00:02:03.029
No!

00:02:09.953 --> 00:02:12.086
Wings of Regret!

00:02:12.129 --> 00:02:13.740
[LAUGHING EVILLY]

00:02:19.528 --> 00:02:21.225
Hmm. Oh, yeah.

00:02:21.269 --> 00:02:22.531
First day
of panda training!

00:02:22.574 --> 00:02:24.359
All right, flower.

00:02:24.402 --> 00:02:26.317
I'm gonna
make you bloom.

00:02:26.796 --> 00:02:28.363
Whoo-hoo!

00:02:28.406 --> 00:02:29.973
Dad. Dad.

00:02:30.017 --> 00:02:31.453
What? What? What is it?

00:02:31.496 --> 00:02:33.107
I'm ready for my first day
of panda training.

00:02:33.150 --> 00:02:34.499
What? You know, learn to be

00:02:34.543 --> 00:02:36.414
a panda, master chi,
save the world!

00:02:36.458 --> 00:02:38.813
Pandas sleep till past noon.

00:02:38.876 --> 00:02:41.815
[YAWNING] So lesson number one is,
"Go back to bed."

00:02:41.985 --> 00:02:43.683
Oh! Of course!

00:02:46.729 --> 00:02:48.165
Nobody said this was
gonna be easy.

00:02:50.472 --> 00:02:52.430
[SNORING]

00:02:54.389 --> 00:02:55.653
Did I oversleep? [LAUGHS]

00:02:55.912 --> 00:02:56.957
You sure did.

00:02:57.000 --> 00:02:58.262
Yes!

00:02:58.306 --> 00:02:59.481
Yeah! Show him, kids!

00:02:59.524 --> 00:03:01.439
Can you do this?
Can you do that?

00:03:01.483 --> 00:03:02.702
How about this?
How about that?

00:03:02.745 --> 00:03:04.486
Am I doing it? Is this good?
Whoa!

00:03:04.529 --> 00:03:05.835
I got it! Ka-blam!

00:03:06.880 --> 00:03:08.272
ALL: Whoa!

00:03:08.316 --> 00:03:09.722
Grandma Panda, heads up!
Hello! Ow!

00:03:09.752 --> 00:03:11.145
Oh. Uh-oh.

00:03:11.188 --> 00:03:12.407
We better roll.
[WHISTLING]

00:03:13.103 --> 00:03:15.018
Po, lunch time.

00:03:15.062 --> 00:03:16.527
Oh!

00:03:18.500 --> 00:03:19.675
[GROANS]

00:03:21.546 --> 00:03:23.287
Po? [GRUNTS]

00:03:23.331 --> 00:03:25.376
You gotta let the hill
tell you where to roll.

00:03:25.420 --> 00:03:27.045
Oh! Rookie mistake.

00:03:27.098 --> 00:03:30.251
Dim, Sum, let's show him
how we go uphill!

00:03:30.294 --> 00:03:32.079
BOTH: Whoo-hoo!

00:03:32.122 --> 00:03:33.689
It's beautiful.

00:03:33.733 --> 00:03:36.213
Snack time. Po! Whoo-hoo!

00:03:36.257 --> 00:03:38.085
You can fly?

00:03:38.128 --> 00:03:40.783
I'm coming in hot! [GROANS]

00:03:40.827 --> 00:03:42.350
Get them while
they're cold. Hmm.

00:03:43.307 --> 00:03:45.135
[CUBS LAUGHING] [SCREAMS]

00:03:45.179 --> 00:03:46.441
What are you doing there?

00:03:46.484 --> 00:03:47.921
That food is for Po![BLOWS]

00:03:47.964 --> 00:03:49.018
Throw it in!

00:03:51.576 --> 00:03:54.536
There, there.
That's it.

00:03:54.579 --> 00:03:56.799
Feeling relaxed?Totally.

00:03:56.843 --> 00:03:59.376
Just let yourself
fall into it.

00:03:59.492 --> 00:04:00.542
Got it.

00:04:02.326 --> 00:04:04.720
[GROANING]

00:04:04.764 --> 00:04:06.461
I'm fine. I just...
[VOMITING]

00:04:06.504 --> 00:04:08.768
There we go.
Just let it all out.

00:04:08.811 --> 00:04:09.986
[VOMITING] That's my boy.

00:04:12.467 --> 00:04:13.691
MR. PING: Get out of there!

00:04:13.714 --> 00:04:15.209
[CUBS GIGGLING]

00:04:16.079 --> 00:04:17.385
Oh! My noodles!

00:04:17.428 --> 00:04:19.052
Leave my noodles alone.

00:04:23.043 --> 00:04:24.976
Subtle, Po. Very subtle.

00:04:24.990 --> 00:04:26.292
Let me get some of that.

00:04:26.350 --> 00:04:27.395
Oh!

00:04:28.309 --> 00:04:30.089
Hey, leave my hat alone!

00:04:30.137 --> 00:04:31.557
[GROANING]

00:04:33.618 --> 00:04:35.446
ALL: We love noodles!

00:04:35.490 --> 00:04:36.708
More noodles!

00:04:36.752 --> 00:04:38.275
Oh! Just like my Po.

00:04:38.319 --> 00:04:39.886
[SCREAMING]

00:04:43.585 --> 00:04:45.354
What are you guys
looking at?

00:04:47.632 --> 00:04:49.069
[PANDAS CHEERING]

00:04:51.680 --> 00:04:54.335
That's how we roll!
Cannonball!

00:04:54.378 --> 00:04:56.032
[PANDAS LAUGHING]

00:04:56.076 --> 00:04:57.120
Whoo-hoo! Yeah!

00:05:00.602 --> 00:05:02.386
[CUBS LAUGHING PLAYFULLY]

00:05:07.696 --> 00:05:09.524
Here, bring it up here.

00:05:09.567 --> 00:05:11.598
Mom, look it! Whoa!

00:05:13.223 --> 00:05:14.921
[BREATHES DEEPLY]

00:05:16.444 --> 00:05:17.735
How was that?

00:05:20.100 --> 00:05:21.101
[BREATHES DEEPLY]

00:05:21.666 --> 00:05:23.668
Whoa!

00:05:23.712 --> 00:05:26.628
Now, you try again.
But don't try so hard.

00:05:26.671 --> 00:05:28.021
Okay. Okay.

00:05:28.064 --> 00:05:32.242
[BREATHES DEEPLY]

00:05:33.243 --> 00:05:34.897
Much better.

00:05:35.637 --> 00:05:37.857
[LAUGHING][GRUNTING]

00:05:42.992 --> 00:05:44.210
Thanks, Dad.

00:05:44.559 --> 00:05:46.213
For what?

00:05:46.256 --> 00:05:48.258
You know, just for,
you know,

00:05:48.302 --> 00:05:49.477
showing me
what it feels like...

00:05:50.521 --> 00:05:51.871
to be a panda.

00:05:53.465 --> 00:05:56.658
So, when do you think I'll be ready?
Ready?

00:05:56.721 --> 00:05:58.553
You know, to learn
how to master chi.

00:05:58.747 --> 00:06:01.576
Soon. Real soon.

00:06:01.619 --> 00:06:02.857
Come on, I wanna show you
something else.

00:06:02.881 --> 00:06:03.988
Come on.

00:06:07.634 --> 00:06:10.948
Sorry about the mess.
I don't usually get visitors.

00:06:21.465 --> 00:06:23.990
Is this my mom?

00:06:30.083 --> 00:06:32.912
I had this done
on your 100th day.

00:06:34.304 --> 00:06:35.784
Hmm.

00:06:35.827 --> 00:06:37.481
Your momma couldn't
hold you still.

00:06:38.874 --> 00:06:41.659
You nearly ate the paper.
[BOTH CHUCKLING]

00:06:41.703 --> 00:06:43.040
It's true.

00:06:43.313 --> 00:06:44.394
What was she like?

00:06:44.532 --> 00:06:45.706
Oh!

00:06:46.577 --> 00:06:49.522
She was the total package.

00:06:50.625 --> 00:06:53.933
Smart, beautiful...

00:06:53.976 --> 00:06:55.568
tremendous appetite.

00:06:55.592 --> 00:06:57.501
[LAUGHING]

00:06:57.545 --> 00:07:00.374
She was the love
of my life.

00:07:00.417 --> 00:07:03.464
And then, just when I thought
I couldn't get any luckier...

00:07:04.421 --> 00:07:05.640
along you came.

00:07:05.683 --> 00:07:08.382
My Little Lotus.

00:07:08.425 --> 00:07:09.609
[CHUCKLES]

00:07:10.514 --> 00:07:12.038
I really had it all...

00:07:13.996 --> 00:07:17.913
until that one moment...

00:07:21.482 --> 00:07:25.442
when I lost everything.

00:07:26.443 --> 00:07:27.967
[WOLF HOWLING]

00:07:33.537 --> 00:07:35.409
[COOING]

00:07:40.805 --> 00:07:43.069
[BABY PO CRYING]

